  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "my oven fan keeps going after ive turned the oven off, been about 20 mins now. is it broken??"
  },
  {
   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "That is actually normal behaviour. Most ovens have a dedicated cooling fan that runs after you switch off to keep the controls and cabinet cool; it typically runs for 10–30 minutes until the oven has cooled down sufficiently. It is only a fault if the fan continues running indefinitely even when the oven is completely cold, or if you hear loud grinding noises. If it stops eventually, there is no need to worry."
  }
